    "detailed_description": "<strong>Developed by students at the University of Utah</strong><br><br>A chess-inspired roguelike with flash-inspired graphics. As King, accumulate and command your army across a series of procedurally generated train carts. Outsmart a variety of unique enemies, capture them, and add them to your team... but one wrong step, and you lose them forever!<br><br><strong>What are you willing to sacrifice in order to reach the front?</strong><br><br>Monkey Barrel Games, LLC is a nonprofit organization run by students at the University of Utah. All internal proceeds go to providing opportunities to aspiring game developers!",
